simple-computer-use
===================

This project contains code and design adapted from Agent-S
(https://github.com/simular-ai/Agent-S), Copyright Simular AI,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Adapted portions include: the visual-grounding prompt and coordinate
resolution strategy (scu/grounding.py), the OCR word-box extraction
(scu/ocr.py), and platform-aware action implementations (scu/actions.py).

The Agent-S harness (agent loop, planner/reflection, trajectory memory,
benchmark runners) is intentionally not included; this project provides the
tool layer only, for use by any external agent.

